,"kind":"person","person_id":"423_9wn_ew3","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p008","text":"項梁起東阿，西，（北）［比］至定陶，再破秦軍，項羽等又斬李由，益輕秦，有驕色。宋義乃諫項梁曰：「戰勝而將驕卒惰者敗。今卒少惰矣，秦兵日益，臣為君畏之。」項梁弗聽。乃使宋義使於齊。道遇齊使者高陵君顯，曰：「公將見武信君乎？」曰：「然。」曰：「臣論武信君軍必敗。公徐行即免死，疾行則及禍。」秦果悉起兵益章邯，擊楚軍，大破之定陶，項梁死。沛公、項羽去外黃攻陳留，陳留堅守不能下。沛公、項羽相與謀曰：「今項梁軍破，士卒恐。」乃與呂臣軍俱引兵而東。呂臣軍彭城東，項羽軍彭城西，沛公軍碭。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"李由","kind":"person","person_id":"423_9wn_ew3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"uj9_x5q_yir","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"uj9_x5q_yir","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"齊使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0094","start":94,"end":98,"surface":"高陵君顯","kind":"person","person_id":"r97_1b3_zvn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m008-0105","start":105,"end":1